## The returns desk

::bg{location="library_reading_room" time="afternoon"}
::auto{character="ines" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
::set{run.seen.ines = run.day}
@ines{code="0010" emotion="neutral"}: Oh. It's you.
@narrator{code="0010"}: She slides a parcel across the desk without looking up. The sheets inside are the colour of weak tea.
@ines{code="0020"}: I kept them. Wednesday. In case.
::set{run.lantern.paper = true}
@sol{code="0010"}: Ines, I'm sorry, I —
@ines{code="0030" emotion="sad"}: It's fine. It's paper. Mind the corners.
::auto{character="ines" action="fadeOut"}
